WHAT THIS COVERS

  data/cognitive_core/     sealed panels and answer authorities
  runs/cognitive_core/     per-response receipts and model manifests
  results/                 analysis outputs

  These are generated artifacts: the panels are procedurally constructed with
  per-item nonce vocabularies, and the receipts record this project's own
  scoring runs. No third-party dataset is redistributed here.


WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER

  Software. Everything under scripts/, render/, tools/ and src/ is MIT
  licensed. See LICENSE.

  Model weights. Not redistributed. Each run records the pinned revision and a
  hash of the weight files under runs/.../control/model-manifest.json; the
  weights themselves remain under their publishers' own licences.

  ProofWriter. scripts/validate_closure_against_proofwriter.py downloads the
  public ProofWriter corpus at runtime to validate the forward-closure
  certifier. That corpus is NOT included in this repository and is not
  covered by this licence; it remains under its own terms. No item from it is
  scored by any model in the accompanying paper.


HOW TO CITE

